# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Hostel Management System — environment variables
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the real value:
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# NEVER commit the real .env to git (it is already gitignored).
# On Vercel / Railway, set these in the dashboard instead.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# PostgreSQL connection string (required).
# Free cloud PostgreSQL: https://neon.tech → create a project → copy the
# POOLED connection string from the dashboard.
# Example:
#   DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@ep-xxxx-pooler-region.aws.neon.tech/dbname?sslmode=require"
DATABASE_URL=""
